WEBVTT

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:08.670
Sightseeing?

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:11.620
Actually, we're here to fight spirals.

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:11.990
Yes, yes!

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:13.320
We sightseeing!

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:15.700
Sightseeing tour! Only! 'Kay?

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:26.370
Have a nice trip!

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:27.960
Thank you!

00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:29.580
Thanks...

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:31.010
Are you sure about this?

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:35.210
We came to the Animal Realm 
on a spiral-hunting job.

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:36.270
Idiot.

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:39.230
If you tell the truth, you need a work visa.

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:40.800
So we just say we're tourists.

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:44.150
We're going to go sightseeing, 
too, so it's okay.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:46.520
Is that how it works?

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:47.970
What are you guys doing?

00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:49.500
Hurry! Hurry!

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.580
My hometown's got a ton of stuff to see!

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:52.660
Let's hurry!

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:54.350
You look excited, Gajeru.

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:55.170
Yeah!

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:57.030
It's been ages since I've 
been to the Animal Realm.

00:00:57.340 --> 00:00:59.400
I'll get to see my cute little sister, too!

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:02.980
All my relatives and the whole neighborhood 
will be there to welcome us!

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:05.410
But our first priority is work, right?

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:08.470
The job's the usual spiral hunting.

00:01:08.470 --> 00:01:09.960
Our client is Mimosa-san.

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:12.030
That's your sister, right?

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:14.390
Yeah... I guess.

00:01:14.390 --> 00:01:16.070
Yeah. I guess.

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:18.610
Yeah, that Mimosa can be so silly sometimes.

00:01:18.610 --> 00:01:20.040
She can't do anything without me.

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:23.460
Something's coming.

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:30.200
Mimosa!

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.230
You came to welcome me?

00:01:32.810 --> 00:01:34.440
That's Gajeru's little sister?

00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:36.250
I'm back, Mimosa!

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:37.780
Your big brother is home!

00:01:42.770 --> 00:01:46.360
Who said you could
come home, my dumb brother?

00:01:46.360 --> 00:01:47.510
Nice to meet you.

00:01:47.510 --> 00:01:48.780
I'm Mimosa.

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:51.870
Thank you for being my brother's friends.

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:18.950
<b>~ the journey to the end of the despair ~</b>

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:26.600
<b>Episode 7: Animal Friends</b>

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:28.030
The spirals were defeated a long time ago?

00:03:28.030 --> 00:03:28.900
Yes.

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:33.580
Anybody in the Animal Realm can 
easily take out a weak spiral.

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:36.640
And we'd never ask someone 
from another Realm for help.

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:38.600
Then why'd you give us the job?

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:43.960
This dummy brother of mine 
faked my name on the quest.

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:46.020
Oh, you knew?

00:03:46.020 --> 00:03:47.610
Of course I did!

00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:50.010
I thought it was so weird how you said 
you were coming home all of a sudden.

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:53.200
I questioned the rest of the family, 
and they quickly confessed.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.710
I told them to keep it a 
secret from you, though.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:04:00.160
I didn't expect you to come to the 
border to welcome me, though.

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:02.110
Well, I just...

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:06.390
I just wanted to kick your stupid 
butt as soon as possible!

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:08.180
There's nothing to be 
embarrassed about, Mimosa.

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:11.130
Looks like they get along after all, huh?

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:13.720
Yeah. One of those tsundere 
little sisters, she is.

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:15.350
I'm not embarrassed!

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:17.570
Don't make them think I'm a tsundere!

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:21.570
But Gajeru, why'd you fake a quest, anyway?

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:25.730
After we visited Liza's homeland,
 I wanted to pay a visit to my home, too.

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:27.620
And it'd be easier to justify 
if there was a quest, right?

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:28.740
Jeez...

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:32.070
I can't believe I came all the 
way out here for this idiot.

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:35.980
Give up. He's always been an idiot.

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:38.840
I'm sorry my dumb brother did that to you,

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:44.220
but since you're here,
why not do some sightseeing?

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:45.440
Sightseeing?

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:46.330
Yes.

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:51.900
I've actually already reserved a 
really popular guide named Yumiru!

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:53.850
Okay, president, everyone...

00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:56.920
I'll... be back.

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:58.830
Yeah, do a good job, okay?

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:02.010
Yumiru is amazing!

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:06.910
Before, nobody cared about tourism here.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:09.770
But thanks to him, it's getting more popular.

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:13.770
And now it's a major part 
of the city's economy!

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:16.760
And what's more, Yumiru's a boy,

00:05:16.760 --> 00:05:21.110
but he's got the kind of cuteness 
you'd only find once in a millennium.

00:05:21.110 --> 00:05:23.720
It's a miracle I was able to 
get a reservation at all!

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:26.440
But is he really any good?

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:28.430
It won't just be a whirlwind tour
 of all the major landmarks,

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:31.770
followed by long stops at the gift shop,
 and then a long ride home

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:35.560
on a busy freeway where we can't 
even get a bathroom break, right?

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:37.670
Sounds like a bad bus tour.

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:39.520
Don't worry!

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:43.790
Everyone, welcome to the Animal Realm,

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:45.930
the land of dreams and adventures!

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:48.630
I'm Yumiru, your guide!

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:49.460
Nice to meet you!

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:52.600
He's so cute!

00:05:52.600 --> 00:05:54.760
Definitely once-in-a-millennium cuteness!

00:05:55.890 --> 00:05:59.550
It's very easy to enjoy the Animal Realm!

00:05:59.550 --> 00:06:01.790
Just empty out your head and heart,

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:04.450
pretend you're a child,
 and express how you're feeling!

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:06.180
Just enjoy it?

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:07.250
That's right!

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:10.340
There're only two things you should say.

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:12.510
"Wow," and, "This is fun!"

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:13.460
"Wow," and...

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:14.680
"This is fun"?

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:16.430
Let's get started...

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:19.880
...with the "Nature Is Your Friend"
 Animal Friends Tour!

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:26.870
What do you think, everyone?

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:29.440
Wow! This is fun!

00:06:34.070 --> 00:06:35.830
The rage of wild beasts!

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:38.210
Wow! This is fun!

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:41.050
A r-r-really b-b-bumpy r-r-road!

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:44.200
W-W-Wow! Th-Th-This is f-f-fun!

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:50.590
Some clouds!

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:51.540
Wow!

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:52.460
A store!

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:53.380
This is fun!

00:06:53.380 --> 00:06:54.470
Food!

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:55.910
Wow!

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:56.560
More food!

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:58.710
This is fun!

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:02.870
I hope you all had fun today, everyone.

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:06.330
The last thing I have to show you 
on this tour is this sunset!

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:09.620
Wow... This was.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:12.940
Fun... this was.

00:07:13.980 --> 00:07:17.160
Yumiru, thanks so much for today!

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:20.230
We were all able to really enjoy ourselves!

00:07:20.230 --> 00:07:21.120
Yeah!

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:24.580
Yumiru, you're a friend who's 
good at being a tour guide!

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:25.880
Thank you.

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:31.710
I'm lucky to have wonderful people 
like you for my last tour.

00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:33.530
Last?

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:35.670
What does that mean, Yumiru?

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:41.510
Actually... I have to quit my job today.

00:07:41.510 --> 00:07:43.480
What's the meaning of this, Mayor?

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:45.580
Don't make a monkey out of me, okay?

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:49.290
I want Yumiru called off the tour guide job!

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:51.840
This is an official decision, kemo.

00:07:51.840 --> 00:07:55.850
But the Animal Realm's tourism 
industry owes Yumiru a huge debt!

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:59.300
And there are still lots of 
tourists that come to see him.

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:01.670
But he's a boy.

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:07.060
The days where we let 
Yumiru go ape are over.

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:11.120
He will be replaced by these 
110 beautiful girl guides,

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:15.090
and the Animal Realm's tourism industry 
will move into a new cash cow phase.

00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:22.050
Seeing all the looks of surprise, happiness,

00:08:22.050 --> 00:08:26.650
or emotion on the faces of the 
tourists was what I lived for.

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:30.110
But I have to do what they tell me to.

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:31.570
That's not fair!

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:34.740
You're the best guide our country has!

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.050
I had a great time today!

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:39.540
They can't just tell you to quit!

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:42.300
Well, I'm sure the mayor would 
rather have a girl doing the job.

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:45.120
But Yumiru did nothing wrong.

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:48.330
It makes me happy just to hear you say that.

00:08:48.330 --> 00:08:52.230
But it's too late to change things.

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:53.560
It is not!

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:55.680
It's too late to change clothes?

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.370
Choco, this is important.

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:59.080
Leave this to me.

00:08:59.420 --> 00:09:04.470
I owe you a debt for making me feel so
great with your wonderful sightseeing tour.

00:09:04.470 --> 00:09:05.590
Liza-san...

00:09:05.590 --> 00:09:07.650
But what can you do?

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:08.910
I hate to say it,

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:12.200
but changing the city's 
decision isn't that easy.

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:13.270
Don't worry.

00:09:13.270 --> 00:09:16.730
What really changes things 
isn't the pen or the sword.

00:09:16.730 --> 00:09:20.450
It's the voices of the nameless
 masses crying out for justice!

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:25.760
<i>Thank you for coming today.</i>

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:32.510
<i>I'm afraid that I've been asked 
to leave my job as tour guide.</i>

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:36.800
<i>Basically, the mayor told me I had to quit.</i>

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:39.850
<i>I'm sorry. I'm very disappointed, too.</i>

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:42.140
Mommy, is Yumiru-san going to quit?

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:45.180
No, I'm sure it's some kind of mistake.

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:46.000
That's right.

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:47.600
It must be some kind of mistake!

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:51.010
Th-The whole Animal Realm 
owes a debt to Yumiru!

00:09:51.010 --> 00:09:53.100
We need him to keep his job!

00:09:53.100 --> 00:09:54.780
Let's go tell the mayor we're mad!

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:57.600
Yeah, let's go protect our Yumiru!

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:01.160
What are you doing, Haru? It's your turn!

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:03.350
Yu...

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:05.060
Yumiru!

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:06.530
Yumiru!

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:10.260
Yumiru! Yumiru!

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:15.290
Yumiru! Yumiru! Yumiru!

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:20.080
Yumiru! Yumiru! Yumiru!

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:20.590
<b>LasPeri</b>

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:39.820
Arc End Branch Office #8, Campanella-oneesan (Sky Realm)

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:23.320
You're asking about Erika-san?

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:27.200
She normally works very hard to keep 
Branch Office #8 running.

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:30.120
But she can also be very cute and silly!

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:32.310
This particular Erika-san has long hair,

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:35.040
and is very good at whipping people!

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:38.530
If you ask her, I'm sure she'd love 
to whip you once or twice!

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:41.530
<b>LasPeri</b>

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:56.590
Arc End Branch Office #8, Erika-oneesan (Human Realm)

00:10:42.180 --> 00:10:44.300
Campanellas are very bossy, 
and they always laugh.

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:46.600
But you never know what they're thinking,

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:49.210
and they're hard to figure out.

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:51.510
Ours seems to always be wandering 
around doing something or other.

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:55.610
I wish she'd contribute to my attempts to 
rebuild the Branch Office a little more.

00:10:56.590 --> 00:10:57.510
<b>LasPeri</b>

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:01.730
Don't fire Yumiru!

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:02.930
Don't fire him!

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:04.780
Don't let the mayor get away with this!

00:11:04.780 --> 00:11:05.880
Don't let him get away with this!

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:10.430
Just as planned.

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:12.750
Everybody's making a huge fuss over it.

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:15.100
But is this okay?

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:17.020
It's turned into such a big deal.

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:18.750
That's what we want.

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:21.860
If nothing big happens, 
nobody will talk about it.

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:25.060
At this point, the mayor 
can't just ignore it.

00:11:25.710 --> 00:11:28.400
You're right. It looks like 
the announcement about that

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:31.510
new group of pretty girl tour 
guides has been delayed.

00:11:31.510 --> 00:11:33.670
But what happens now?

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:38.850
Even if this gets bigger, it doesn't 
guarantee that Yumiru can keep his job.

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:39.810
Yes.

00:11:39.810 --> 00:11:43.480
I don't want to cause any 
more chaos in town, either.

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:44.170
Don't worry.

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:46.640
I've already taken my next step.

00:11:47.090 --> 00:11:48.820
Come out, Mayor!

00:11:48.820 --> 00:11:50.460
Don't fire Yumiru!

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:53.180
Look at 'em, swarming like ants out there!

00:11:53.180 --> 00:11:55.060
What do we do, Mayor?

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:57.810
Your approval ratings are tanking!

00:11:57.810 --> 00:11:59.230
That cat's out of the bag!

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:00.640
For now, we hold our horses.

00:12:00.640 --> 00:12:03.030
Elephants never forget, but people do.

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:07.600
If we just stick our heads in the 
sand until this blows over, we win.

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:08.870
I-I see!

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:09.760
Smart thinking, Mayor!

00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:13.080
Mayor, the protesters have changed tactics!

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:18.390
They're gathering signatures, demanding 
that Yumiru be allowed to keep his job.

00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:22.520
So now they're trying to 
do things the legit way, kemo?

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:24.480
No need to hurry!

00:12:24.480 --> 00:12:26.490
We've got lots of pens and paper.

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:27.310
Just line up.

00:12:27.310 --> 00:12:30.270
Make sure you only sign once, okay?

00:12:30.510 --> 00:12:32.980
Good work, Gajeru, Mimosa.

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:34.240
How's it looking?

00:12:34.760 --> 00:12:37.190
Look at all the signatures we got, guys.

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:38.820
If people just get mad and protest,

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:42.220
eventually they'll forget about it,
 and nothing will change.

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:46.800
It was really smart thinking to switch 
to a signature campaign, Liza-san.

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:50.290
Well, I'm just really smart, I guess.

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:55.580
Don't hit people, Choco!

00:12:56.110 --> 00:12:57.720
I just felt mad for some reason.

00:12:57.720 --> 00:13:00.340
Look at you guys, messing around again.

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:02.500
Wiseman!

00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:04.880
Why are you showing up this late?

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:07.490
You can't get in our way now.

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:10.460
This time, we've got all 
these people on our side.

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:12.880
Is that all?

00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:13.400
What?

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:18.060
Are those all signatures?

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:20.800
Surprised? Surprised?

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:22.860
We ran all over the realm to get them, guru!

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:25.250
It was a lot of work to get here.

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:28.070
We can't leave until we beat you.

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:31.660
Let's compete to see who can 
get the most signatures today.

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:33.210
Sounds fun.

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:34.760
She's back.

00:13:35.590 --> 00:13:38.200
I'm in!

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:40.450
Come one, come all!

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:42.440
Sign the Wiseman petition!

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:44.660
Sign the Wiseman petition, guru!

00:13:44.660 --> 00:13:47.860
Act now, and you can
 shake Kikazaru's hand, guru!

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:49.060
Sign the petition!

00:13:49.060 --> 00:13:50.300
Welcome!

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.390
Thanks for coming today!

00:13:52.870 --> 00:13:55.260
Wow, did that really happen?

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:58.020
We're the original Yumiru petition!

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:00.970
Sign now and you can pet Miu all you want!

00:14:00.970 --> 00:14:02.670
Miu's super-fluffy!

00:14:03.510 --> 00:14:05.770
It's for Yumiru. Put up with it.

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:08.250
I'm back!

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:10.080
I brought them!

00:14:10.610 --> 00:14:11.700
The whole family!

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:15.240
Grandpa, Grandma, Auntie, Uncle, 
my cousins, my second cousins,

00:14:15.240 --> 00:14:16.890
and even the neighbor!

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:19.170
Hey, it's been a while, Gajeru.

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:21.170
We're here to sign your petition.

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:24.270
Hey, no fair calling your relatives, guru!

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:26.160
It's called the home field advantage.

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:29.120
If you don't like it, 
then go call somebody!

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:32.000
Fine, guru!

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:32.770
Luluna!

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:33.940
Right!

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:36.010
Time to call.

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:46.060
There he is!

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:49.220
The Legendary Beastman, Nero,

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:51.880
the strongest in the Animal Realm, is back!

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:55.090
You guys again?

00:14:55.090 --> 00:14:56.440
N-Nero-san?

00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:58.460
Th-The legend?!

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:00.350
What do we do, Dummy Brother?

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:03.660
We can't beat Nero-san!

00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:05.920
Nero-sensei, we need your help, guru!

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:09.000
Use your five-star power
to sign this petition, guru.

00:15:10.730 --> 00:15:11.730
Are we done?

00:15:11.730 --> 00:15:14.510
Yes, thank you, guru.

00:15:15.410 --> 00:15:16.730
You guys give up, guru?

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:19.030
This is Nero-sensei's signature, guru.

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:21.030
Kneel before us, guru!

00:15:21.030 --> 00:15:24.740
You know, even if he's a five-star, he still 
only counts as one signature, right?

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:26.060
Yeah, you're right.

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:29.340
That was really inefficient, guru!

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:30.410
Are you stupid?

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:32.970
Looks like we can win, huh?

00:15:33.440 --> 00:15:37.490
It feels like this barely has 
anything to do with me anymore.

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:39.160
That's not true.

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:41.060
No matter who wins,

00:15:41.060 --> 00:15:43.600
we're getting a ton more signatures.

00:15:43.930 --> 00:15:47.500
We might even be able to 
get the mayor to resign!

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:49.680
Don't worry, Yumiru.

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:52.890
We'll make it so you can 
keep your job! I promise!

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:56.730
W-Wait!

00:15:56.730 --> 00:15:59.960
The King is about to go to sleep!

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:02.560
You can't just demand an 
audience at this hour!

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:04.320
Shut up, or I'll freeze you solid.

00:16:07.560 --> 00:16:08.810
Nero?

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:10.230
What do you want?

00:16:10.230 --> 00:16:11.700
Get that smirk off your face.

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:12.940
I know you.

00:16:12.940 --> 00:16:15.080
You've known about what's going 
on in that town the whole time.

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:16.780
You mean Yumiru?

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:20.740
I got caught up in that crap because 
you're not doing your job.

00:16:20.740 --> 00:16:23.760
If you're supposed to be the king,
then keep an eye on your damn kingdom!

00:16:26.930 --> 00:16:29.440
You're always such a meddler.

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:34.080
Now, come out, Mayor.

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:38.400
We have all these signatures demanding 
that Yumiru be allowed to keep his job!

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:42.280
Hey, which of us ended up winning?

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:46.060
I think they just decided 
that nobody really cared, guru.

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:47.340
Are they for real?

00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:48.680
Yeah, yeah.

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:57.180
Now, what will you do, Mayor?

00:16:57.180 --> 00:16:59.580
Can you ignore the voices 
of all these people?

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:01.980
You're going to let Yumiru 
keep his job, right?

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:05.110
No matter how signatures you gather,

00:17:05.110 --> 00:17:08.420
Yumiru has to quit his job cold turkey!

00:17:09.450 --> 00:17:10.430
No!

00:17:10.430 --> 00:17:11.540
What's going on?

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:12.480
What's wrong with you?

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:13.300
Are you serious?

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:17.370
With all these people, we can 
easily get you recalled!

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:19.510
If you want to do that, then go ahead, kemo.

00:17:19.770 --> 00:17:23.300
The elephant in the room is that
 I'm doing this because I believe in it!

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:26.390
Are you done having a cow?

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:28.980
Then I'm going back
 to working like a dog.

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:31.320
Are you sure about that, Mayor?

00:17:35.100 --> 00:17:36.790
The S-Spirit King!

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:38.120
What are you doing here?

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:39.400
Who's the Spirit King?

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:41.810
The King of the Animal Realm!

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:44.030
He's super-strong and super-important!

00:17:44.030 --> 00:17:47.620
Each town has its own rules.

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:51.030
Ordinarily, I'm not supposed to get involved.

00:17:51.350 --> 00:17:54.890
But so many of your people have 
voiced their disagreement.

00:17:55.320 --> 00:18:02.540
Isn't it your duty as a ruler to 
humbly hear them out, Mayor?

00:18:02.920 --> 00:18:05.750
You've... got the tiger by the tail.

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:11.970
Everyone, I declare in the 
name of the Spirit King

00:18:11.970 --> 00:18:18.110
that Yumiru will be allowed to 
keep his job as tour guide,

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:19.700
just like he always has!

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:23.280
Yumiru!

00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:24.460
Yes!

00:18:24.460 --> 00:18:25.840
We did it!

00:18:25.840 --> 00:18:27.750
I lost like a dog.

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:30.900
I got too caught up in my own idea,

00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:32.250
became stubborn,

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:35.830
and became a tyrant who bullishly
 ignored what everyone else felt.

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:37.750
I won't try to weasel out of this.

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:40.860
As of today, I resign from
 my position as mayor, kemo!

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:41.630
Wait!

00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:44.770
I get to keep being a guide.

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:47.840
There's no need for you to quit.

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:49.550
Yumiru...

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:56.520
Spirit King, the mayor has 
done a lot to help the city.

00:18:56.810 --> 00:19:00.320
He can't quit just because of this.

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:01.630
He just can't!

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:03.540
Yumiru...

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:05.810
You're right.

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:09.820
I think it would be a shame 
if the mayor quit, too.

00:19:10.770 --> 00:19:11.700
Mayor!

00:19:11.990 --> 00:19:13.920
You heard what Yumiru said.

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:19.940
Why not tell us why you wanted him to quit?

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:23.010
W-Well...

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:29.190
I went whole hog for changing the industry
so it didn't totally depend on Yumiru.

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:36.570
It's true that the Animal Realm's tourism 
industry has prospered thanks to Yumiru.

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:42.750
But because of that, he's had to work 
as a guide for days without breaks.

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:46.360
At this rate, he's going to burn out
 and drop like a fly someday.

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:48.640
What a crappy industry.

00:19:48.640 --> 00:19:50.200
Choco, this is important.

00:19:50.480 --> 00:19:55.380
That was a concern of the 
Tourism Association, too.

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:58.010
But we have a limited budget,

00:19:58.010 --> 00:20:01.040
and it was hard to train 
someone to replace him.

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:04.460
So in order to reduce the load on Yumiru,

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:08.160
you decided that the city would create a 
group of attractive young female tour guides,

00:20:08.160 --> 00:20:10.390
and have Yumiru train them.

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:12.530
That was the plan, right?

00:20:13.430 --> 00:20:14.740
Mayor...

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:15.890
So that was it.

00:20:15.890 --> 00:20:17.690
That means Yumiru could 
pass his experience on

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:19.770
to a lot of different people, doesn't it?

00:20:19.770 --> 00:20:23.230
And if they all became famous, 
like the Ten Jewels...

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:24.740
More tourists would come!

00:20:25.150 --> 00:20:27.700
You should've just said so!

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:29.950
Then this wouldn't have 
gotten so complicated.

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:33.120
Th-The cat had my tongue!

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:37.380
I couldn't say that I was a huge fan of Yumiru,
 and that I was really worried he was too busy.

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:46.630
Thank you so much, Mayor!

00:20:47.070 --> 00:20:50.310
From now on, I'll try to keep 
to a reasonable schedule.

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:52.400
So please let me train the new girls.

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:53.620
Th-Then...

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:57.120
You'll help the new group 
of pretty chick tour guides?

00:20:57.120 --> 00:20:58.410
Of course!

00:20:58.410 --> 00:21:01.430
Together, we'll all make the
 Animal Realm great again!

00:21:04.350 --> 00:21:07.070
Everyone, it's all settled!

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:08.770
In the Animal Realm,

00:21:08.770 --> 00:21:10.210
we have lots of animals,

00:21:10.210 --> 00:21:12.410
and nobody is left out!

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:18.890
Hey, why were we even here this episode?

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:22.540
Who cares? All's well that ends well.

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:28.600
They're all friends again.

00:21:30.830 --> 00:21:32.460
If only reality could be like this.

00:21:36.640 --> 00:21:42.370
Everyone, thanks for helping me!

00:21:42.370 --> 00:21:45.080
Now, let's all dance!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.990
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.990
<b>Episode 8
Swimsuit Episode</b>

00:23:36.510 --> 00:23:38.030
"Swimsuit Episode."
